{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"平\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"big\": \"X\",\n    \"small\": \"平\",\n    \"core\": \"Y\",\n    \"concise\": \"平\",\n    \"human\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\",\n    \"load\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"big 判 X：X 的大块直接交代人物状态、原因和转折，单看大字也比较容易串起整条心理变化；Y 的高亮词虽然短而醒目，但部分关系必须依赖未放大的文字才能理解。small 判平：两边小字都有能补充画面和体验的内容，也都有一定程度的重复或音乐描写偏多的问题；core 判 Y：Y 更清楚地呈现了维护尊严与怀念归属之间反复拉扯的过程，最终也把两者如何共存交代得更完整。concise 判平：X 有近义表达重复，例如 S02 的“不甘心消亡”和“负隅顽抗”，Y 则有小字重复主句意思、部分跨屏回环的情况；human 判 Y，X 的“负隅顽抗”“旧日亲近、感激鲜活”“不因害怕收回先过稳日子的打算”等具体措辞显得生硬或书面化。fine 判 X：X 的感受更多落在胸口、脚步、呼吸、回望等观众自身的具体体验上，Y 有不少感受实际上在描述和弦、旋律和音乐走向；load 判 Y：Y 的高亮短语明显更短，尤其 X 的 S10—S12 大块在较短停留时间内信息量偏大。总体两边各有明显优势，综合判平。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "78748f6f-1245-448d-826a-426ca49d62aa", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261111T045813478242Z", "elapsed_seconds": 295.938, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T05:03:09.429802+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "69f8e7d1d0b30897ae6e2fda801a6e63248320d087d9b0dbabd689a0355040cb", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256":